{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24676","headline":"偶作寄朗之 · 白居易","name":"偶作寄朗之","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"历想爲官日，无如刺史时。\n欢娱接宾客，饱暖及妻儿。\n自到东都後，安闲更得宜。\n分司胜刺史，致仕胜分司。\n何况园林下，欣然得朗之。\n仰名同旧识，爲乐即新知。\n有雪先相访，无花不作期。\n鬬醲乾酿酒，夸妙细吟诗。\n里巷千来往，都门五别离。\n岐分两回首，书到一开眉。\n叶落槐亭院，冰生竹阁池。\n雀罗谁问讯，鹤氅罢追随。\n身与心俱病，容将力共衰。\n老来多健忘，唯不忘相思。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24676.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24676","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}